      "statement": "evaluate_bpb computes bits per byte as summed per-token nats divided by ln(2) times the summed byte lengths of target tokens from the token_bytes table, excluding zero-byte special tokens and ignore-index targets, all-reducing both sums across ranks and returning infinity when no bytes were counted.",
